# awesome-pages config for the docs/ root.
#
# Without this file mkdocs's nav at the top level would be a flat
# alphabetical list of all 18 root-level .md files plus every
# subdirectory — which makes the Material `navigation.tabs` bar
# unreadable. This file groups them into logical sections so the
# tab bar reads like:
#
#   Home · EMDR research · Bilateral timing & sync · Architecture & dev
#       · Reference · Antikythera · Chess · Othello · Logo
#       · UTLP & cross-cutting research · ADRs · Archive
#
# When you add a new top-level .md file under docs/, decide which
# section it belongs to and append it to the relevant nav entry.

nav:
  - Home: index.md

  - EMDR research:
      - EMDR_bilateral_stimulation_Evidence-based_parameters_for_clinical_practice.md
      - EMDR_Slow_BLS_Research_Frontier.md

  - Bilateral timing & sync:
      - Bilateral_Time_Sync_Protocol_Technical_Report.md
      - Achieving_sub_1ms_time_synchronization_over_BLE_on_ESP32.md
      - Advanced_Architectural_Analysis_Bilateral_Pattern_Playback.md
      - Bilateral_Pattern_Playback_Plus_UTLP_Integration_Plan.md
      - bilateral_pattern_playback_architecture.md
      - Emergency_Vehicle_Light_Sync_Proven_Architectures_for_ESP32_Adaptation.md
      - 802.11mc_FTM_Reconnaissance_Report.md

  - Architecture & dev:
      - architecture_decisions.md
      - ESP-NOW_vs_BLE_Power_Analysis.md
      - ESP_IDF_BUILD_CONSTRAINTS.md
      - ESP_IDF_SOURCE_SELECTION.md
      - CONNECTION_HEALTH_METRIC_PROPOSAL.md
      - RESEARCH_PLATFORM_FEATURES.md

  - Reference:
      - ai_context.md
      - requirements_spec.md
      - KNOWN_ISSUES.md

  # Master architecture notebook for the spectral-research collection.
  # Listed first as the cross-domain pollination layer above the
  # per-domain notebooks; per-domain notebooks remain the authoritative
  # home for their domain.
  - srmech

  # Major sub-projects in alphabetical order; each has its own
  # .pages file controlling internal ordering.
  - antikythera-maths
  - chess-maths
  - othello-maths
  - logo-maths

  # Cross-cutting + archival.
  - misc
  - adr
  - archive
